2026-07-27T11:28:35.3678821Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:28:35.3679148Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:28:35.3679631Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:28:35.3680703Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:28:35.3681528Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
